text:
Mechanisms exist to perform inventories of technology assets that:

Accurately reflect the current systems, applications, and services in use;
Identify authorized software products, including business justification details;
Are at the level of granularity deemed necessary for tracking and reporting;
Include organization-defined information necessary to achieve effective property accountability;
Are available for review and audit by designated organizational personnel.

